{"id":"ed0d7bb02f212291","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-stlc-context-invariance.md","title":"简单类型推导的上下文不变性","display":"lem-stlc-context-invariance — 简单类型推导的上下文不变性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-stlc-context-invariance","aliases":["72-lem-stlc-context-invariance"],"display":"lem-stlc-context-invariance — 简单类型推导的上下文不变性","depends_on":["[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; inherited supplementary sources not rechecked","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-stlc-context-invariance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-stlc-context-invariance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-stlc-context-invariance — 简单类型推导的上下文不变性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; inherited supplementary sources not rechecked"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>类型、项、有限上下文及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span> 的有限偏函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\Lambda_\\to\">\\(M\\in\\Lambda_\\to\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\)</span> 取同一避免捕获语法的项自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\)</span> 指函数图包含。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)=\\Delta\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)=\\Delta\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式逐类型推导归纳：变量从上下文读取，应用取并，抽象去掉绑定变量。第二式也对推导归纳；变量与应用直接使用上下文在自由变量上的相等。抽象时先把绑定者改名为避开两个有限上下文的新变量，两边同时扩充相同类型，归纳假设给体的推导，再抽象。反向交换两个上下文。第三式由第一、二式推出。只使用原有三个typing规则，不将上下文弱化当作未给定的原始规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类型、项、有限上下文及 $\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A$ 取 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]；$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为到 $\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$ 的有限偏函数，$M\\in\\Lambda_\\to$，$A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\Lambda_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{FV}(M)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)=\\Delta\\restriction\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\land\\Gamma\\vdash_\\to M:A\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\Delta\\vdash_\\to M:A.","display":true}],"bytes":2104,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-423","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-context-invariance|lem-stlc-context-invariance — 简单类型推导的上下文不变性]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-context-invariance]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-457","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-stlc-context-invariance|lem-stlc-context-invariance — 简单类型推导的上下文不变性]]"},{"id":"790cb6137e1847d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-stlc-context-invariance]]"}],"outgoing":["e38d92d6727e7ead"]}